  "prompt": "A TV lists at 800 euros and costs Voltmarkt 520 euros. For every promotion, return four columns in this order: promo_code; sale_price_eur, the TV's price after that promotion's discount_pct (a percentage such as 25 for 25% off); margin_eur, the sale price minus the 520-euro cost; and margin_pct, margin_eur as a percentage of sale_price_eur (such as 25 for 25%), rounded to 2 decimals with ROUND(x, 2). Round only margin_pct. Use exactly these column names. One row per promotion, every promotion included; a margin can be negative. Any row order is fine.",
